## Additional Notes

- No code changes were required as the configuration was already complete
- The implementation follows best practices for React + Vite applications
- Analytics will automatically track page views and custom events once deployed to Vercel
- To enable analytics data collection, ensure Web Analytics is enabled in the Vercel dashboard

## Next Steps for Deployment

To start collecting analytics data:

1. Deploy the application to Vercel using `vercel deploy`
2. Enable Web Analytics in the Vercel dashboard for this project
3. Visit the deployed site to generate analytics data
4. View analytics in the Vercel dashboard after user visits

